          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "DIN 1946-7 requires at least 25 m³/h per person and, in addition, an eightfold air change per hour for laboratory rooms. For work with hazardous substances under TRGS 526 the requirement can rise to a 10- to 15-fold air change. In cleanrooms still higher values apply, depending on the ISO class." }
